sleep-question-3-option-3\", \"label\": \"一般\", \"score\": 3}, {\"id\": \"d6-assessment-sleep-question-3-option-4\", \"label\": \"有时\", \"score\": 2}, {\"id\": \"d6-assessment-sleep-question-3-option-5\", \"label\": \"经常\", \"score\": 1}], \"optionCount\": 5}], \"totalScore\": 15, \"description\": \"用于第一阶段快速筛查患者近期睡眠、焦虑和晨间情绪波动。\"}}, \"rules\": [\"on-time\"]}', 'timeline', 15, 1, '2026-03-10 12:59:34', '2026-03-10 12:59:35', NULL);
